XB3_7 (b2 out vdd vss vdd vss) INHDV32
ends buffer
subckt buffers (in out vdd vss)
XB0_0 (in b0 vdd vss vdd vss) INHDV1
XB1_0 (b0 b1 vdd vss vdd vss) INHDV4
XB2_0 (b1 b2 vdd vss vdd vss) INHDV16
